1
00:00:00,066 --> 00:00:01,534
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,534 --> 00:00:03,003
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,436 --> 00:00:05,205
(Episode 72)

4
00:00:05,271 --> 00:00:06,639
My marriage records are clear now.

5
00:00:07,107 --> 00:00:08,508
So you'll be with me now, right?

6
00:00:14,047 --> 00:00:15,048
Hold me.

7
00:00:15,115 --> 00:00:17,650
I was so scared I'd lose you.

8
00:00:27,027 --> 00:00:30,630
I heard this is the biggest compliment
you can give a pianist.

9
00:00:31,831 --> 00:00:32,899
Na Ji Ni.

10
00:00:33,299 --> 00:00:34,334
What?

11
00:00:35,235 --> 00:00:36,269
One more time.

12
00:00:36,936 --> 00:00:38,038
- Come on!
- One more time!

13
00:00:38,304 --> 00:00:39,372
Come on, let's go.

14
00:00:40,173 --> 00:00:41,174
Where to?

15
00:00:43,810 --> 00:00:45,912
It was hopeless right up until the trial,

16
00:00:46,079 --> 00:00:47,847
but I heard there was a dramatic twist.

17
00:00:48,515 --> 00:00:50,884
Yeong Ju, you were amazing. Great job.

18
00:00:51,217 --> 00:00:53,486
That's our MVP.

19
00:00:54,454 --> 00:00:56,689
Thank you so much. You really saved me.

20
00:00:56,890 --> 00:00:59,125
- Aunt, really...
- That's enough.

21
00:00:59,392 --> 00:01:00,794
Stop it, you're making my head spin.

22
00:01:01,928 --> 00:01:05,398
Your father really knew what he was doing
when he told me to pack those things up.

23
00:01:06,066 --> 00:01:08,601
Come to think of it,
Joong Bin went to court with us.

24
00:01:08,601 --> 00:01:09,869
He went to see my mom.

25
00:01:10,303 --> 00:01:11,571
She didn't come to the trial.

26
00:01:11,604 --> 00:01:13,106
I'm glad he went to see her.

27
00:01:13,506 --> 00:01:15,842
She would've felt bad being alone.

28
00:01:36,963 --> 00:01:37,997
Honey.

29
00:01:47,073 --> 00:01:49,609
Well, say something. Did he win?

30
00:01:52,679 --> 00:01:55,882
Do Hee got caught using AI
to fake Ji Hu's voice.

31
00:01:56,116 --> 00:01:58,818
My goodness. That girl...

32
00:01:58,852 --> 00:02:02,889
If you'd been there, it'd have looked like
his own mother was siding with a criminal.

33
00:02:08,061 --> 00:02:09,129
Is Ji Hu happy?

34
00:02:09,262 --> 00:02:12,031
I can't remember the last time
I saw him smile like that.

35
00:02:13,133 --> 00:02:15,034
Ji Hu isn't your little boy anymore.

36
00:02:15,435 --> 00:02:17,303
Where is he now? At Tae O's?

37
00:02:18,171 --> 00:02:19,205
At Ji Ni's.

38
00:02:19,772 --> 00:02:21,608
Yeong Ju told him he could stay there.

39
00:02:21,674 --> 00:02:25,378
Who is she to tell my son
where he should or shouldn't stay?

40
00:02:26,045 --> 00:02:28,114
Yeong Ju's really pushing it.

41
00:02:28,214 --> 00:02:30,750
He only won today thanks to Yeong Ju.
Don't talk like that.

42
00:02:31,718 --> 00:02:32,886
What's that supposed to mean?

43
00:02:33,086 --> 00:02:35,188
Apologize to Ji Hu and accept Ji Ni.

44
00:02:35,255 --> 00:02:36,256
That's all you have to do.

45
00:02:36,456 --> 00:02:38,358
We're out of options.

46
00:02:38,791 --> 00:02:40,026
That's what I came here to tell you.

47
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:41,227
I said I got it.

48
00:02:41,261 --> 00:02:42,962
Can you just drop it already?

49
00:02:45,331 --> 00:02:46,833
I need to bring Ji Hu back.

50
00:02:47,167 --> 00:02:48,902
I can't leave him there.

51
00:02:51,571 --> 00:02:52,839
He's my son.

52
00:02:52,939 --> 00:02:55,341
No matter how I raised him, I'm his mom.

53
00:03:02,348 --> 00:03:03,483
Yeah, that's good news.

54
00:03:03,583 --> 00:03:05,785
I'm glad
Ji Hu's marital records are clear now.

55
00:03:06,719 --> 00:03:08,154
Of course I'm happy too.

56
00:03:08,855 --> 00:03:12,025
My mood? I'm just a little tired.

57
00:03:15,862 --> 00:03:18,131
(Witnesses Wanted)

58
00:03:22,802 --> 00:03:23,803
(If you saw the motorcycle accident,)

59
00:03:23,803 --> 00:03:24,737
(or saw what happened before or after it,
please contact us.)

60
00:03:27,006 --> 00:03:29,976
Okay, Ji Ni. See you tonight.

61
00:03:31,277 --> 00:03:32,378
Yeah.

62
00:04:10,850 --> 00:04:12,685
Dad!

63
00:04:12,919 --> 00:04:13,953
Go on, get going.

64
00:04:14,153 --> 00:04:15,188
Dad!

65
00:04:19,025 --> 00:04:20,526
Dad!

66
00:04:21,461 --> 00:04:22,595
Dad!

67
00:04:26,032 --> 00:04:27,200
Dad!

68
00:04:37,343 --> 00:04:40,313
Back then, I just couldn't forgive him.

69
00:04:42,315 --> 00:04:44,217
I was so angry.

70
00:05:01,968 --> 00:05:03,569
Got it!

71
00:05:09,509 --> 00:05:14,681
That's right. It's just you guys.

72
00:05:19,352 --> 00:05:21,154
You're the lucky one tonight.

73
00:05:30,863 --> 00:05:33,266
What's this?

74
00:05:35,601 --> 00:05:37,270
Well, would you look at that.

75
00:05:57,357 --> 00:05:59,125
So this is where it was.

76
00:05:59,292 --> 00:06:02,428
I thought she took it with her
when she got married.

77
00:06:21,581 --> 00:06:23,416
Mother.

78
00:06:26,152 --> 00:06:27,186
Mother, are you okay?

79
00:06:28,521 --> 00:06:29,655
Yes, I'm fine.

80
00:06:30,056 --> 00:06:32,091
I heard the news.

81
00:06:33,192 --> 00:06:35,128
I'm so happy for you.

82
00:06:37,029 --> 00:06:38,531
My son-in-law.

83
00:06:39,065 --> 00:06:40,266
You sweet thing.

84
00:06:40,767 --> 00:06:41,901
My baby.

85
00:06:43,936 --> 00:06:45,571
You're mine now.

86
00:06:47,106 --> 00:06:48,708
I'm sorry I made you worry.

87
00:06:48,775 --> 00:06:52,745
No. All's well that ends well.

88
00:06:52,879 --> 00:06:56,149
Thanks to all that,
Ji Ni finally opened up to you.

89
00:06:56,349 --> 00:06:59,018
Otherwise, it would've dragged on forever.

90
00:06:59,218 --> 00:07:00,686
You know what I mean?

91
00:07:01,087 --> 00:07:04,791
Yes. By the way, why were you
in the storage room?

92
00:07:04,891 --> 00:07:07,326
For this.

93
00:07:07,794 --> 00:07:11,798
Ji Ni pours all the alcohol she finds
down the sink.

94
00:07:11,864 --> 00:07:13,032
What a waste.

95
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:15,935
Looks like even you're scared of Ji Ni.

96
00:07:16,102 --> 00:07:18,671
Yeah. She's the only one who scares me.

97
00:07:19,238 --> 00:07:22,041
Soften her up with your love, will you?

98
00:07:22,775 --> 00:07:23,776
I'll do my best.

99
00:07:24,544 --> 00:07:26,679
That's right, you sweet thing.

100
00:07:28,548 --> 00:07:29,549
Okay.

101
00:07:29,916 --> 00:07:31,951
How about having a party tonight?

102
00:07:32,351 --> 00:07:34,654
My uncle's coming over
to pop some champagne.

103
00:07:34,987 --> 00:07:37,690
Really? I'm always up for a party.

104
00:07:38,558 --> 00:07:42,395
Don't tell anyone I sneak in and out
of that storage room.

105
00:07:43,162 --> 00:07:45,865
Nobody knows I take drinks from there.

106
00:07:46,332 --> 00:07:47,400
Don't worry.

107
00:07:53,406 --> 00:07:54,974
Here I am again.

108
00:08:01,681 --> 00:08:02,949
What is that?

109
00:08:17,063 --> 00:08:18,664
- Does that feel good?
- Yes.

110
00:08:19,432 --> 00:08:22,201
This is amazing. How are you so good?

111
00:08:22,935 --> 00:08:25,037
I do this for my mom a lot at home.

112
00:08:25,571 --> 00:08:28,040
She's sensitive and has trouble sleeping.

113
00:08:28,140 --> 00:08:30,176
Yeah, she looked kind of high-strung.

114
00:08:30,910 --> 00:08:33,679
Don't you ever make Ji Ni do this.

115
00:08:33,813 --> 00:08:35,314
Her hands are for painting.

116
00:08:35,414 --> 00:08:36,749
Of course, I know.

117
00:08:36,983 --> 00:08:38,417
I'll do all the housework too.

118
00:08:41,687 --> 00:08:43,289
Are you out of your mind?

119
00:08:44,490 --> 00:08:46,092
After everything I did for you!

120
00:08:46,692 --> 00:08:48,394
I'm speechless. Seriously.

121
00:08:50,263 --> 00:08:52,965
Hello, in-law. What a surprise.

122
00:08:52,965 --> 00:08:54,200
In-law?

123
00:08:54,867 --> 00:08:57,336
Unbelievable. Dream on.

124
00:08:57,570 --> 00:09:00,273
Our families will never become in-laws.
You, come with me.

125
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:01,707
Mom.

126
00:09:01,807 --> 00:09:05,044
Don't touch him. He's my son-in-law.

127
00:09:05,678 --> 00:09:07,747
- He's mine now.
- What?

128
00:09:08,180 --> 00:09:09,682
Whose? Yours?

129
00:09:09,682 --> 00:09:11,817
- What are you doing here?
- Don't do this, son.

130
00:09:12,518 --> 00:09:14,287
You're breaking my heart.

131
00:09:15,187 --> 00:09:17,290
She's the mother of the woman I love.

132
00:09:17,557 --> 00:09:19,625
- Please treat her well.
- I can't.

133
00:09:20,893 --> 00:09:23,796
How could you put your own mother
through this for that woman's daughter?

134
00:09:23,796 --> 00:09:24,931
You're unbelievable.

135
00:09:25,631 --> 00:09:29,869
You're here giving her a foot massage?

136
00:09:30,803 --> 00:09:33,806
Why are you hitting my son-in-law?
Talk it out.

137
00:09:34,874 --> 00:09:37,009
I know you're upset.

138
00:09:37,209 --> 00:09:40,980
You may think little of me,
but Ji Ni has done nothing wrong.

139
00:09:41,347 --> 00:09:45,885
So stop picking on Ji Ni and Ji Hu.
Their love is pure.

140
00:09:46,152 --> 00:09:47,820
It's better for you too.

141
00:09:47,820 --> 00:09:49,522
Who are you to give me advice?

142
00:09:55,861 --> 00:09:57,129
Mom!

143
00:09:59,198 --> 00:10:01,267
Go on.

144
00:10:01,400 --> 00:10:04,203
Go talk things over with her
and come back tonight.

145
00:10:04,604 --> 00:10:06,005
- I will.
- Okay.

146
00:10:36,936 --> 00:10:43,576
With this, I'll get Ji Ni married
and finally move out on my own.

147
00:10:57,189 --> 00:11:01,894
Or maybe the three of us
could live together?

148
00:11:02,662 --> 00:11:06,932
Ji Ni, Ji Hu, and me.

149
00:11:18,978 --> 00:11:20,479
Sit down for a minute.

150
00:11:30,089 --> 00:11:31,290
Did you hate playing the piano?

151
00:11:33,125 --> 00:11:36,562
Did you only do it because of me?

152
00:11:38,964 --> 00:11:40,800
At first, yes.

153
00:11:42,101 --> 00:11:46,338
You were so happy
every time I won a piano award.

154
00:11:48,307 --> 00:11:49,809
And grandma would praise me too.

155
00:11:50,309 --> 00:11:51,477
Yes, I know.

156
00:11:53,112 --> 00:11:54,947
I'm sorry.

157
00:11:55,147 --> 00:12:00,653
I had postpartum depression
for a long time.

158
00:12:02,121 --> 00:12:04,023
So I left you with my mother.

159
00:12:05,524 --> 00:12:08,360
I really regret it. I was wrong.

160
00:12:09,795 --> 00:12:11,464
You deserved...

161
00:12:13,165 --> 00:12:15,367
so much better from me.

162
00:12:17,103 --> 00:12:20,239
I was distant with you
because your dad wasn't around.

163
00:12:21,407 --> 00:12:23,008
I'm sorry for that.

164
00:12:24,610 --> 00:12:26,178
No, it's okay.

165
00:12:27,446 --> 00:12:30,916
I'm sorry you had to bring up
something from so long ago.

166
00:12:31,817 --> 00:12:36,021
When you said I was just like Do Hee,

167
00:12:37,957 --> 00:12:43,395
that I'm a mother who only uses you,
it really shook me.

168
00:12:45,197 --> 00:12:49,869
I only said that because
you didn't understand how I felt.

169
00:12:50,503 --> 00:12:52,004
You're not like that.

170
00:12:52,238 --> 00:12:55,775
I'm sorry I said
you and Do Hee were alike.

171
00:12:55,841 --> 00:12:57,109
Ji Hu.

172
00:13:00,246 --> 00:13:03,716
You're my one and only son.

173
00:13:04,683 --> 00:13:07,319
I know I've wronged you a lot
since you were little,

174
00:13:08,687 --> 00:13:10,656
but please forgive me.

175
00:13:13,225 --> 00:13:14,593
Don't cry, Mom.

176
00:13:14,860 --> 00:13:17,930
I'll always be grateful to you.

177
00:13:18,998 --> 00:13:23,235
Even if there are things about Ji Ni
you don't like, please let them slide.

178
00:13:26,338 --> 00:13:32,011
Do I really have to be
in-laws with that woman?

179
00:13:33,245 --> 00:13:34,580
Please, Mom.

180
00:13:41,787 --> 00:13:46,058
Mom, I have plans tonight.
I'll be back later.

181
00:13:53,499 --> 00:13:56,802
Na Ji Ni.

182
00:13:57,736 --> 00:13:59,905
Na Ji Ni, honestly.

183
00:14:15,621 --> 00:14:16,755
Hello.

184
00:14:18,858 --> 00:14:20,559
I'm sorry, Mom.

185
00:14:20,860 --> 00:14:21,994
England?

186
00:14:23,062 --> 00:14:25,497
How am I supposed to study now?

187
00:14:26,498 --> 00:14:28,667
I'm not going to England.
I'll do something else.

188
00:14:29,301 --> 00:14:30,736
I'm going to start a business.

189
00:14:31,237 --> 00:14:34,573
I'll make enough money to ensure
Na Ji Ni's art never sees daylight.

190
00:14:34,707 --> 00:14:38,377
Cut the crap, come back quietly,
and do what your father tells you.

191
00:14:39,078 --> 00:14:41,247
Otherwise, we'll both get kicked out.

192
00:14:41,614 --> 00:14:43,549
What a disgrace.

193
00:14:43,949 --> 00:14:45,017
I'm sorry.

194
00:14:46,952 --> 00:14:48,587
I said I'm not going to England.

195
00:14:48,754 --> 00:14:50,489
And now he wants me to go to college?

196
00:14:50,789 --> 00:14:53,826
Tell dad to get over his obsession
with prestigious schools.

197
00:15:04,470 --> 00:15:06,705
Why are you alone? Where's your lawyer?

198
00:15:07,506 --> 00:15:10,676
I'm waiting for him.
Congratulations, Ji Hu.

199
00:15:11,076 --> 00:15:12,912
But don't think this is over.

200
00:15:13,579 --> 00:15:16,115
I won't let you and Na Ji Ni
live happily ever after.

201
00:15:17,716 --> 00:15:19,051
For once, we agree.

202
00:15:19,218 --> 00:15:20,653
I don't want you living in peace either.

203
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:22,421
- Ji Hu.
- England?

204
00:15:22,855 --> 00:15:27,126
You messed with someone's life like that
and think you'll get off this easily?

205
00:15:27,159 --> 00:15:28,861
You won.

206
00:15:29,495 --> 00:15:31,530
- Isn't that enough?
- Not even close.

207
00:15:31,931 --> 00:15:35,501
That's just the verdict.
Your punishment starts now.

208
00:15:36,602 --> 00:15:38,704
Filing a false marriage registration.

209
00:15:38,704 --> 00:15:40,906
Falsifying official records.

210
00:15:40,906 --> 00:15:42,975
You lied to public officials,

211
00:15:44,310 --> 00:15:50,049
causing false information to be entered
into official records. You'll be charged.

212
00:15:52,051 --> 00:15:53,118
Ji Hu, why are you doing this?

213
00:15:53,252 --> 00:15:57,790
I only dropped charges for your accident
because I'd lost my memory.

214
00:15:58,223 --> 00:16:01,760
I'll find a way to hold you accountable
for that too. Just you wait.

215
00:16:03,262 --> 00:16:04,363
You're being way too harsh.

216
00:16:04,463 --> 00:16:06,932
And what you did to Ji Ni wasn't?

217
00:16:07,266 --> 00:16:09,735
You've looked down on everyone
since middle school.

218
00:16:12,705 --> 00:16:16,275
If your parents didn't raise you right,
it's time you learned.

219
00:16:18,210 --> 00:16:20,245
You're scaring me. Why are you like this?

220
00:16:21,013 --> 00:16:23,482
I'm sorry. I was wrong.

221
00:16:25,184 --> 00:16:28,020
You only apologize
when you're backed into a corner.

222
00:16:29,121 --> 00:16:30,856
It makes me sick.

223
00:16:32,057 --> 00:16:33,492
You're not sorry at all.

224
00:16:34,226 --> 00:16:35,661
You don't even know what you did wrong.

225
00:16:38,831 --> 00:16:41,300
What do I have to do to make it up to you?

226
00:16:44,003 --> 00:16:46,638
Apologize to Ji Ni. And mean it.

227
00:16:47,072 --> 00:16:51,677
Get on your knees and beg.
Put your pride and life on the line.

228
00:16:53,412 --> 00:16:57,249
If Ji Ni is kind enough to forgive you,
I'll let you off the hook too.

229
00:16:57,449 --> 00:17:00,152
You want me to apologize to a mistress?
Are you serious?

230
00:17:00,319 --> 00:17:02,054
Who are you calling a mistress?

231
00:17:02,888 --> 00:17:03,956
Watch your mouth.

232
00:17:04,456 --> 00:17:05,657
She's going to be my wife.

233
00:17:07,026 --> 00:17:09,328
If you won't apologize, don't.
Face the consequences.

234
00:17:09,628 --> 00:17:11,497
I'd actually love to fight you.

235
00:17:12,197 --> 00:17:13,932
I'm bound to win anyway.

236
00:17:16,535 --> 00:17:18,437
Tell your lawyer everything I said.

237
00:17:20,739 --> 00:17:25,044
Hey! What am I supposed to do?
Unbelievable.

238
00:17:27,613 --> 00:17:30,883
Sorry. I saw Im Ji Hu leave.
What did he say?

239
00:17:32,017 --> 00:17:34,186
He's suing me again.

240
00:17:34,653 --> 00:17:36,355
What am I supposed to do?

241
00:17:38,257 --> 00:17:39,625
I can't take this case.

242
00:17:40,025 --> 00:17:41,493
Find another lawyer.

243
00:17:43,328 --> 00:17:45,164
Why? What now?

244
00:17:55,507 --> 00:17:58,777
If you freeze it like this,
it doesn't get lumpy.

245
00:17:59,111 --> 00:18:01,880
- And it keeps the freezer neat.
- Yes, exactly.

246
00:18:02,181 --> 00:18:04,750
I've been copying how you do it.

247
00:18:05,350 --> 00:18:08,554
My mom can't be bothered to wash and dry
milk cartons, so she freezes things as is.

248
00:18:08,720 --> 00:18:10,956
Your mom thinks everything's a hassle.

249
00:18:13,358 --> 00:18:15,627
My ring.

250
00:18:16,295 --> 00:18:17,896
I took it off earlier while tidying up.

251
00:18:18,297 --> 00:18:19,631
- Just a minute.
- Okay.

252
00:18:22,801 --> 00:18:26,371
- When did you get here?
- What's it to you?

253
00:18:26,738 --> 00:18:28,107
I came to get my things. So what?

254
00:18:28,340 --> 00:18:29,975
Why don't you go cozy up
with Na Ji Ni some more?

255
00:18:30,809 --> 00:18:31,944
Some official wife. No self-respect.

256
00:18:32,177 --> 00:18:34,313
You're so fond of a mistress's daughter.

257
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:36,949
What? How dare you!

258
00:19:04,109 --> 00:19:07,579
I need to teach her a lesson.

259
00:19:07,946 --> 00:19:09,214
Hey!

260
00:19:09,915 --> 00:19:13,352
What do you think you're doing?

261
00:19:13,585 --> 00:19:15,320
This could get serious!

262
00:19:18,090 --> 00:19:19,091
Hey!

263
00:19:21,627 --> 00:19:23,362
Why am I the only one everyone hates?

264
00:19:23,962 --> 00:19:25,397
Why does everyone hate me?

265
00:19:31,737 --> 00:19:34,173
Ma'am, are you okay?

266
00:19:35,307 --> 00:19:36,542
Hey, stop right there!

267
00:19:37,910 --> 00:19:40,812
Let's go to the hospital.
This stuff is toxic.

268
00:19:41,313 --> 00:19:43,348
What kind of girl does that?

269
00:19:43,815 --> 00:19:46,251
I think it got in my eyes.
They're burning.

270
00:19:48,820 --> 00:19:50,622
Are you okay?

271
00:19:53,892 --> 00:19:56,828
Apologize to Ji Ni. And mean it.

272
00:19:57,095 --> 00:20:01,700
Get on your knees and beg.
Put your pride and life on the line.

273
00:20:03,302 --> 00:20:05,737
I can't. I could never do that.

274
00:20:09,675 --> 00:20:10,976
I can't wait any longer.

275
00:20:11,076 --> 00:20:13,512
I think I should take Yeong Ju
to the hospital.

276
00:20:14,012 --> 00:20:16,048
They're here.

277
00:20:17,282 --> 00:20:20,185
Yeong Ju. Are you okay?

278
00:20:20,719 --> 00:20:23,322
I'm fine. I hid under a blanket in time.

279
00:20:24,389 --> 00:20:25,457
Are you okay?

280
00:20:25,824 --> 00:20:27,693
I ended up kicking her across the room.

281
00:20:28,160 --> 00:20:29,294
I really didn't want to.

282
00:20:30,395 --> 00:20:32,798
Anyway, the house is a mess now.

283
00:20:33,398 --> 00:20:35,300
Why worry about that now?

284
00:20:35,534 --> 00:20:37,336
I'll call a cleaning service
to take care of the house.

285
00:20:37,936 --> 00:20:39,972
Don't tell the kids.

286
00:20:40,172 --> 00:20:41,540
It'll just ruin the good mood.

287
00:20:42,574 --> 00:20:44,243
Do Do Hee, seriously.

288
00:20:44,710 --> 00:20:47,779
- She's leaving the country. Forget it.
- She can't leave.

289
00:20:48,513 --> 00:20:50,015
She has to face the consequences
before she leaves.

290
00:20:50,415 --> 00:20:51,717
And there are plenty of charges.

291
00:20:53,318 --> 00:20:54,987
That's my nephew! Well done.

292
00:21:07,199 --> 00:21:08,267
Here we go.

293
00:21:11,536 --> 00:21:14,172
Yeong Ju, thanks for all your hard work.
Great job, everyone.

294
00:21:14,673 --> 00:21:16,475
Congratulations, Ji Hu.

295
00:21:17,209 --> 00:21:18,443
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

296
00:21:19,211 --> 00:21:20,279
Thank you.

297
00:21:21,913 --> 00:21:23,448
Thank you, Aunt.

298
00:21:23,849 --> 00:21:26,184
Today's MVP, No Yeong Ju.

299
00:21:26,418 --> 00:21:29,354
- Stop it already.
- Thanks, Yeong Ju.

300
00:21:29,955 --> 00:21:33,558
Now we just need to add Ji Ni's name
to the cleared marriage record, right?

301
00:21:33,825 --> 00:21:36,094
- Mom!
- What?

302
00:21:36,361 --> 00:21:38,864
Just thinking about it makes me cry.

303
00:21:39,197 --> 00:21:41,733
Ji Ni is finally getting
a new family record.

304
00:21:42,334 --> 00:21:45,070
- You never did, even when I begged.
- Hey.

305
00:21:45,337 --> 00:21:48,607
Isn't this moving a little too fast?

306
00:21:49,341 --> 00:21:50,409
Did you even propose?

307
00:21:50,609 --> 00:21:52,477
My mom's just getting ahead of herself.

308
00:21:52,511 --> 00:21:53,578
Don't mind her.

309
00:21:54,146 --> 00:21:56,014
Hey, what's too fast?

310
00:21:56,315 --> 00:21:58,417
Love hits you just like that.

311
00:21:58,650 --> 00:22:01,653
What, does love send a warning first?
If it did, I'd have run.

312
00:22:05,357 --> 00:22:07,592
Did you get the flyers out?

313
00:22:07,693 --> 00:22:10,529
What if you get flooded
with prank calls and scammers?

314
00:22:11,596 --> 00:22:13,632
Yes, you have to watch out for scammers.

315
00:22:14,966 --> 00:22:16,335
I'll handle it.

316
00:22:18,337 --> 00:22:22,140
Here you go, Ji Hu!

317
00:22:22,741 --> 00:22:26,311
- What a good boy!
- Mom!

318
00:22:26,478 --> 00:22:27,713
Why do you keep calling me?

319
00:22:28,113 --> 00:22:31,583
- You two, go buy some ice cream.
- Ice cream?

320
00:22:31,750 --> 00:22:32,784
Go get some.

321
00:22:33,018 --> 00:22:35,520
Since I can't drink,
I might as well have ice cream.

322
00:22:36,621 --> 00:22:38,657
But why are your eyes so red, Mom?

323
00:22:38,857 --> 00:22:40,025
Is it pink eye?

324
00:22:40,092 --> 00:22:42,561
I was going to say something too.
Are you feeling okay?

325
00:22:42,994 --> 00:22:44,162
No. It's just...

326
00:22:44,663 --> 00:22:47,065
Weren't you two going to get ice cream?

327
00:22:47,165 --> 00:22:49,234
Yes. We'll bring back
the best ice cream in the world.

328
00:22:50,902 --> 00:22:52,804
- We'll be back.
- Okay.

329
00:22:55,173 --> 00:22:58,243
I know she's my daughter,
but she's gorgeous.

330
00:23:05,650 --> 00:23:09,287
- What is it?
- Nothing. I'll be right back.

331
00:23:11,656 --> 00:23:13,725
- Sa Bin, let me pour you a drink.
- Thanks.

332
00:23:13,992 --> 00:23:16,728
- Thank you.
- You two must be so happy these days.

333
00:23:17,462 --> 00:23:20,532
Not a very romantic first date, is it?

334
00:23:21,299 --> 00:23:23,835
This isn't a date.
It's just a night stroll.

335
00:23:24,136 --> 00:23:27,906
True. Should we take a photo booth picture
to remember today?

336
00:23:29,608 --> 00:23:32,077
Looking this shabby? Maybe next time.

337
00:23:33,211 --> 00:23:34,579
How will you show up next time?

338
00:23:35,714 --> 00:23:37,349
Well, just...

339
00:23:38,350 --> 00:23:40,519
Don't you know it's the face
that makes the outfit?

340
00:23:41,486 --> 00:23:42,954
You're confident about your looks.

341
00:23:43,388 --> 00:23:45,791
You fell for me because I'm pretty.
Didn't you?

342
00:23:48,560 --> 00:23:49,761
I'm Na Ji Ni.

343
00:23:49,761 --> 00:23:52,631
Even high school boys
would crowd around to see me.

344
00:23:53,832 --> 00:23:56,701
I was one of the legendary heartthrobs
at my arts high school.

345
00:23:57,102 --> 00:23:58,804
I wonder if you've heard about it.

346
00:24:02,174 --> 00:24:04,409
I was so surprised when I first met you.

347
00:24:05,310 --> 00:24:08,413
You're pretty, but you do flying kicks,
and your art is so serene.

348
00:24:09,080 --> 00:24:10,482
Who is this woman?

349
00:24:11,116 --> 00:24:13,885
How can an artist and her work
be so different? That's what I thought.

350
00:24:15,420 --> 00:24:16,488
What did you think of me?

351
00:24:16,888 --> 00:24:18,023
Didn't I tell you?

352
00:24:19,958 --> 00:24:23,895
A pushover who fell for Do Hee's lies
and a man full of misguided convictions.

353
00:24:25,330 --> 00:24:26,531
I shouldn't have asked.

354
00:24:31,336 --> 00:24:34,806
I'm going to remember today
as the most important day of my life.

355
00:24:35,907 --> 00:24:38,477
Me too.
I feel like I've come out of a tunnel.

356
00:24:39,611 --> 00:24:41,046
Even the air feels different.

357
00:24:45,317 --> 00:24:46,685
I want to ride that.

358
00:25:33,031 --> 00:25:35,567
Why did you come here?
You'll get us in trouble.

359
00:25:36,501 --> 00:25:38,136
Director Cha!

360
00:25:45,210 --> 00:25:46,578
What's gotten into you?

361
00:25:46,578 --> 00:25:49,548
You know how it is with Ji Ni and me.
What were you thinking?

362
00:25:49,948 --> 00:25:52,017
Stop making sense.

363
00:25:52,817 --> 00:25:54,853
Just hold me, please.

364
00:25:55,020 --> 00:25:56,955
I have nowhere else to cry.

365
00:25:57,556 --> 00:25:59,357
No one's on my side.

366
00:26:00,191 --> 00:26:02,127
Everyone just blames me.

367
00:26:02,227 --> 00:26:04,963
And they all take Na Ji Ni's side.

368
00:26:06,631 --> 00:26:08,333
You brought that on yourself.

369
00:26:08,767 --> 00:26:11,303
You drove everyone away
with the way you acted,

370
00:26:11,536 --> 00:26:13,271
so why blame the people around you?

371
00:26:13,271 --> 00:26:14,973
Then what should I have done?

372
00:26:16,575 --> 00:26:21,479
I needed Ji Hu. What was I supposed to do
to hold on to him?

373
00:26:22,814 --> 00:26:24,783
This is the only way I know.

374
00:26:24,783 --> 00:26:27,485
Love? What even is that?

375
00:26:28,954 --> 00:26:34,926
Money's the only way I know to get things.

376
00:26:39,097 --> 00:26:40,632
Keep it down.

377
00:26:43,168 --> 00:26:45,370
Fine, just get up.

378
00:26:47,105 --> 00:26:48,807
Go cry somewhere else.

379
00:26:49,174 --> 00:26:51,910
What do I do now?

380
00:26:52,811 --> 00:26:54,279
Just find another guy.

381
00:26:54,813 --> 00:26:57,682
Im Ji Hu isn't the only man in the world.

382
00:26:58,350 --> 00:27:02,087
Director Cha, is there any hope for me?

383
00:27:04,222 --> 00:27:05,957
Seung Woo, who's here?

384
00:27:08,793 --> 00:27:10,996
You!

385
00:27:11,129 --> 00:27:13,298
Mom, it's not what it looks like.

386
00:27:13,465 --> 00:27:16,568
You're crazy. Now you're after my son?

387
00:27:19,871 --> 00:27:20,972
Mom.

388
00:27:23,108 --> 00:27:25,276
It's not like that.

389
00:27:25,877 --> 00:27:27,612
Why hit her without even listening?

390
00:27:27,712 --> 00:27:28,980
What?

391
00:27:29,848 --> 00:27:34,052
You're taking her side?
Are you crazy? Have you lost your mind?

392
00:27:35,320 --> 00:27:37,288
How long has this been going on?

393
00:27:37,455 --> 00:27:39,224
Nothing's going on. It's not like that.

394
00:27:39,624 --> 00:27:41,426
She came because she wanted to cry.

395
00:27:41,660 --> 00:27:43,461
And Do Hee hasn't done
anything wrong to you.

396
00:27:43,528 --> 00:27:45,196
So why are you hitting her?

397
00:27:45,630 --> 00:27:47,132
I was trying to calm her down
and send her off.

398
00:27:49,267 --> 00:27:52,470
I'll go. I guess I came at a bad time.

399
00:27:53,304 --> 00:27:55,240
Wait. Are you hurt?

400
00:27:55,940 --> 00:27:58,476
Leave. Now.

401
00:27:58,710 --> 00:28:01,046
Mom, stop it.

402
00:28:01,646 --> 00:28:03,782
- She said she's leaving!
- Cha Seung Woo!

403
00:28:31,242 --> 00:28:34,512
(Family Register)

404
00:28:34,713 --> 00:28:36,614
She came here to see me.
So mind your own business.

405
00:28:36,681 --> 00:28:39,384
Director Cha this time?
Can't you stop taking what's mine?

406
00:28:39,484 --> 00:28:41,152
What's this? You thieving bitch.

407
00:28:41,186 --> 00:28:42,987
My mistake was trusting you and Ji Ni.

408
00:28:43,154 --> 00:28:45,156
Ordinary people are the best.

409
00:28:45,323 --> 00:28:46,591
Come visit me at home sometime.

410
00:28:46,758 --> 00:28:48,126
Get along with Ji Hu, too.

411
00:28:48,259 --> 00:28:50,662
Director Cha,
I hope you never regret meeting me.

412
00:28:50,895 --> 00:28:53,998
I hope at least one person
thinks well of me.

413
00:28:55,300 --> 00:28:57,302
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
